    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_memories.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8740136406991207068}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[0]'
      value: Nastulus, please, when even was the last time something like this was
        accepted by the university?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Some\u2026 30 years ago. If my memory doesn\u2019t betray me, that
        is."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[2]'
      value: "This is too much responsibility, I\u2019ve barely finished my studies
        with you!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Mariam, listen to me, I\u2019ve seen many, many students of the stars
        in my time\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[4]'
      value: They are not here in your place today, think about why that is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[5]'
      value: "Master, I want to continue your work and\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[6]'
      value: "I want to teach in your name, I do, but I\u2019m not ready\u2026 I
        don\u2019t think I can be like you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[7]'
      value: "Then teach the things I taught you. And teach them the way I taught
        you\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[8]'
      value: hink of the founding story, you are like al-Fihriya before she decided
        to build the university.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[9]'
      value: "You are about to do something great\u2026 You just don\u2019t know
        it yet."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitleDurationByLetter
      value: 0.1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[10]'
      value: Will it still be proper for me to come to you, when I need your advice?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[11]'
      value: You will always be my most welcome student Mariam. Even though no man-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[12]'
      value: -ever steps in the same river twice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: '_subtitles.Array.data[13]'
      value: I know, Thank you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'Nastulus, please, when even was the last time something like this was
        accepted by the university? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[1].text
      value: "Some\u2026 30 years ago. If my memory doesn\u2019t betray me, that
        is. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[2].text
      value: "This is too much responsibility,  I\u2019ve barely finished my studies
        with you! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[3].text
      value: "Mariam, listen to me, I\u2019ve seen many, many students of the stars
        in my time\u2026  "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[4].text
      value: 'They are not here in your place today, think about why that is. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[5].text
      value: "Master, I want to continue your work and\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[7].text
      value: "I want to teach in your name, I do, but I\u2019m not ready\u2026 I
        don\u2019t think I can be like you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[8].text
      value: "Then teach the things I taught you. And teach them the way I taught
        you\u2026 "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[9].text
      value: 'Think of the founding story, you are like al-Fihriya before she decided
        to build the university. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[10].text
      value: "You are about to do something great\u2026 You just don\u2019t know
        it yet. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[11].text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[12].text
      value: Will it still be proper for me to come to you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[13].text
      value: When I need your advice?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[14].text
      value: You will always be my most welcome student Mariam.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[15].text
      value: Even though no man-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[16].text
      value: -ever steps in the same river twice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[17].text
      value: I know, Thank you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4213974095151647054, guid: 6ce0cebe207ad3a43928c373e8daa03a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: _subtitles.Array.data[18].text
